{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
Yet [C]if I am [C]forsaken I'll [F]not be [C]forsworn,
And he [C]sure is [C]mistaken if he [F]thinks I will [C]mourn.
Oh [C]Johnny is a [Am]young man but still [C]younger am [Am]I,
And [C]often, as he [C]told me, that he'd [F]wed me or [C]die
{end_of_verse}

